    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Regarding the `nerdfonts`, there were no changes to the CSS icon. Instead, a new icon was added, as mentioned in this [commit](https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/commit/fa7b859994228a9c8759f99c55a8d31ee92a1b5e#diff-d953ede3105e41a2f4a93de933a2fee961492da7a445483978895ee5f37a7cd0R1370-R1372). Therefore, I don't believe the current icon (`f031c`) is deprecated.\r\n\r\nBased on the image, the first code `e6b8` is the new icon, while `f031c` is the current one in use. This means that `f031c` is not deprecated.\r\n![imagen](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5cb7c47d-335a-45dd-99c0-798c4c3c9ca5)\r\n\r\n",
