        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> New official icon was added in the scope of https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts/pull/1762, so I guess those who want to preserve the non-official can do so with the settings modifications you mentioned.\n\n\nI understand, thank you for creating the new NerdFonts icon, it is very nice. However, I'm sorry, I am against this PR as it could affect users who are not up to date, forcing them to update on Linux or Windows, which they might not like. As I mentioned, the preferred icon can be changed, as I indicated earlier",
